## Case: collections-str
id: "av.parity.1086.collections-str"
tags: ["av-language-parity", "plan-1086"]
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "main.at"

```auto
fn label() Str {
    return "你".clone() + "好"
}
fn main() int {
    var labels = List<Str>.new()
    let next = label()
    labels.push(next.move)
    let taken = labels.remove(0)
    if taken.len() != 2 { return 0 }
    let copied = taken.clone()
    if copied != "你好".clone() || taken.len() != 2 { return 1 }
    return 42
}
```

### Probe av
recipe: "ac-av/collections-source-run-v1"
entry: "d_main"
exit: 42

