## Case: legacy-99-plan231-006-mutfn-int-return
id: "legacy.99_plan231.006_mutfn_int_return"
entry-mode: "program"

### Auto
path: "mutfn_int_return.at"
```auto
// Test: mut fn returning int (no Option)
type Counter {
    count int

    mut fn next() int {
        self.count = self.count - 1
        return self.count
    }
}

fn main() {
    var c = Counter(3)
    let v1 = c.next()
    print(f"v1: $v1")
    let v2 = c.next()
    print(f"v2: $v2")
    print("mutfn int return OK")
}
```

